{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 13, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest a journey to Japan's shore\nWhere cherry blossoms bloom and ancient temples stand once more\nOur itinerary shall be thus in verse and rhyme so fine\n\nDay the First\nWe set forth from thy home with hearts full of cheer\nAnd board a plane to Tokyo's gates where our adventure doth appear\nUpon arrival thou shalt claim thy luggage and take a rest\nFor tomorrow we shall brave the city's bustling nest\n\nDay the Second\nWe rise with dawn's early light and make our way to Shinjuku's square\nWhere skyscrapers tower high and neon lights do dance with care\nWe shall visit the Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building's height\nAnd from its observation deck behold the city's wondrous sight\n\nDay the Third\nWe take a train to Nikko's hallowed grounds where gods do reside\nAnd visit the Toshogu Shrine a wonder of Japan's pride\nWe shall behold the golden gates and ornate woodwork so fine\nAnd pay our respects to the great Ieyasu's shrine\n\nDay the Fourth\nWe journey to the Fuji Five Lakes region where Mount Fuji doth reign\nAnd take a boat upon Lake Kawaguchi's waters to behold the mountain's grand domain\nWe shall hike and take in the views of Japan's iconic peak so high\nAnd marvel at its beauty that doth touch the evening sky\n\nDay the Fifth\nWe make our way to Kyoto's ancient streets where temples do abound\nAnd visit the Fushimi Inari Shrine with its thousand gates unbound\nWe shall climb the mountain path and behold the vermilion torii's row\nAnd walk in the footsteps of the gods in this sacred place below\n\nDay the Sixth\nWe visit the Kiyomizu-dera Temple a UNESCO World Heritage site so grand\nAnd behold the wooden stage that doth overlook the city's landscape so wide and so bland\nWe shall stroll through the Gion district and behold the geisha's gentle art\nAnd experience the traditional Japan that doth capture the heart\n\nDay the Seventh\nWe rise with dawn's early light and visit the Nijo Castle's halls so fine\nAnd behold the nightingale floors that doth squeak with every step so divine\nWe shall walk the castle's paths and behold the shoguns' grandeur so bold\nAnd learn of Japan's history that doth unfold\n\nDay the Eighth\nWe depart from Kyoto and make our way to Osaka's gates\nWhere food and drink doth abound and the city's vibrant spirit doth create\nWe shall visit the Osaka Castle and behold its grandeur so high\nAnd stroll through the Dotonbori district where neon lights do dance and play\n\nDay the Ninth\nWe visit the Universal Studios Japan where thrills and chills do abound\nAnd ride the rollercoasters and behold the movies' magic so profound\nWe shall experience the world of fantasy and adventure so grand\nAnd end our journey with a bang in this land of wonder so planned\n\nThus endeth our journey to Japan's shores so fair and bright\nMay thy travels be filled with wonder and delight\nFare thee well dear traveler may thy journey be so grand.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.85221833}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.5111953}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.19632839}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.062069237}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.10045276}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -1.0498961}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.11570101}, {"token": "Where", "logprob": -1.8350482}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.88868856}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.007185332}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -4.887569e-06}, {"token": " bloom", "logprob": -0.15539758}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.35543928}, {"token": " ancient", "logprob": -2.395965}, {"token": " temples", "logprob": -0.7457182}, {"token": " stand", "logprob": -0.45516527}, {"token": "